WEBVTT

00:04.610 --> 00:07.820
<b>Ahh, what a nice day!</b>

00:09.360 --> 00:11.620
<b>Following the wind, 
 following their whims,{ep137}</b>

00:11.620 --> 00:14.240
<b>Satoshi and friends’ journey continues.{echoing ep137}</b>

00:14.240 --> 00:16.830
<b>What Pokémon 
 will they meet today?{echoing ep137}</b>

00:20.750 --> 00:22.630
<b>That’s a Delibird!</b>

00:23.040 --> 00:26.630
<b>It’s pretty unusual 
 to see one of those out here.</b>

00:34.760 --> 00:36.640
<b>We’re starving...</b>

00:36.640 --> 00:38.690
<b>...our feet ache...</b>

00:38.690 --> 00:42.440
<b>...and we don’t have anything 
 to report to Sakaki...</b>

00:43.770 --> 00:46.440
<b>That’s Dellie the Delibird!{never named before}</b>

00:46.440 --> 00:48.900
<b>Oh? Why are you here?</b>

00:52.410 --> 00:55.990
<b><i>Boxed lunches!</i></b>

00:56.790 --> 00:58.710
<b><i>Digging in!</i></b>

00:59.410 --> 01:01.830
<b><i>Thank you for the food!</i></b>

01:01.830 --> 01:04.250
<b>Ah, I’m stuffed, meow.</b>

01:04.250 --> 01:06.750
<b>Hey, hey, you got seconds?</b>

01:28.690 --> 01:30.610
<b><i>Wha—?!</i></b>

01:30.610 --> 01:37.370
<b>Pururill! Pumpjin! Koromori! 
 Megayanma! Habunake! It’s been so long!</b>

01:37.370 --> 01:44.130
<b>Maaiika! Manene! Morobareru! 
 Deathmas! Muscippa!</b>

01:44.130 --> 01:47.420
<b>It’s a great big gathering 
 of our Pokémon, meow!</b>

