03:36.990 --> 03:39.450
<b>Musashi. Kojiro. Nyarth.</b>

03:39.450 --> 03:40.830
<b><i>Sakaki, sir!</i></b>

03:41.200 --> 03:44.700
<b>These are the Pokémon 
 you caught across various regions.</b>

03:44.700 --> 03:46.960
<b>Take charge of managing them.</b>

03:46.960 --> 03:48.080
<b><i>S-Sir!</i></b>

03:48.080 --> 03:48.960
<b>That is all.</b>

03:55.720 --> 03:57.840
<b>Thank you, meow, Delibird!</b>

03:57.840 --> 03:59.930
<b>Give our regards to Sakaki!</b>

03:59.930 --> 04:02.310
<b>Thanks for the boxed lunches!</b>

04:02.310 --> 04:08.140
<b>Sakaki will be expecting us to prove our worth 
 with all these Pokémon, meow.</b>

04:08.140 --> 04:09.810
<b>All our Pokémon, huh?</b>

04:09.810 --> 04:15.070
<b>This takes me back... 
 This face, that face, so many missions...</b>

04:32.840 --> 04:35.840
<b>I wonder if they’re all 
 doing well, meow...</b>

04:35.840 --> 04:38.340
<b>For all our graduated Pokémon...!</b>

04:38.720 --> 04:41.340
<b>And to repay Sakaki’s kindness...!</b>

04:41.340 --> 04:44.220
<b>Archenemy Pikachu, 
 we’re gonna get ‘chu!</b>

04:44.220 --> 04:48.230
<b>We’ll be the Team Rocket 
 Revengers, meow!</b>

04:50.350 --> 04:52.100
<b>Awesome! That sounds evil!</b>

04:52.100 --> 04:53.400
<b>What a cool name!</b>

04:53.400 --> 04:55.360
<b>Now we just need 
 to plan an operation, meow.</b>

04:55.360 --> 04:58.320
<b>Ooh, I know, I know! 
 I have a good idea!</b>

04:58.320 --> 04:59.610
<b>Right, Manene?</b>

04:59.610 --> 05:00.990
<b>Mane!</b>

04:59.610 --> 05:00.990
<b>Hmm, yeah!{Well yeah!}</b>

05:00.990 --> 05:05.160
<b>Then why don’t you tell us 
 about this operation of yours?</b>

05:17.840 --> 05:18.920
<b>It’s a Manene.</b>

05:34.560 --> 05:37.730
<b>Pikachu, what’s wrong with it?</b>

05:40.950 --> 05:43.990
<b>It looks like 
 it’s begging for our help.</b>

05:43.990 --> 05:46.950
<b>But Pikachu’s wary of it...</b>

05:51.160 --> 05:52.750
<b>Wh-Whoa... Hey.</b>

06:00.380 --> 06:03.340
<b>Pikachu, we should help it.</b>

06:05.220 --> 06:07.430
<b>Are you okay, Manene?</b>

06:10.140 --> 06:12.100
<b>You ready? Here’s the plan.</b>

06:12.480 --> 06:14.310
<b>First, you go to the brat boys,</b>

06:14.310 --> 06:19.070
<b>and act out “I’m being chased by Team Rocket! 
 Help me!”, making them trust you.</b>

06:19.070 --> 06:20.570
<b>Nod, nod, nod...</b>

06:20.570 --> 06:23.610
<b>And here’s the pose 
 to really sell it!</b>

06:23.610 --> 06:25.700
<b>Manene!</b>

06:39.420 --> 06:41.710
<b>All right! 
 That’s the spirit!{"All right! You understand, my dear Poi, that we must help other Pokémon in need!"}</b>

06:43.260 --> 06:44.180
<b>What’s that?</b>

06:45.180 --> 06:47.800
<b>If you ask us about “this” or “that”...</b>

06:48.260 --> 06:50.560
<b>We’ll answer out of 
 sympathy for the world!</b>

06:50.560 --> 06:53.060
<b>To protect the world from devastation.</b>

06:53.060 --> 06:55.560
<b>To preserve world peace.</b>

06:55.560 --> 06:58.060
<b>Championing the evils 
 of truth and love.</b>

06:58.060 --> 07:00.570
<b>We’re the lovely, charming villains.</b>

07:00.570 --> 07:01.820
<b>Musashi!</b>

07:01.820 --> 07:03.070
<b>Kojiro!</b>

07:03.070 --> 07:06.320
<b>The Team Rocket duo 
 soars{dashes} through the galaxy!{Motto is the same as usual, but animation has kakeru as more direct running...}</b>

07:06.320 --> 07:09.410
<b>Like a white hole, 
 a white tomorrow awaits us!</b>

07:09.410 --> 07:11.490
<b>Just kidding, meow!</b>

07:14.830 --> 07:16.080
<b>Team Rocket!</b>

07:16.080 --> 07:18.210
<b>What do you want?</b>

07:19.540 --> 07:23.090
<b>Manene! 
 You used to be so bad!</b>

07:23.090 --> 07:26.090
<b>How could you turn nice?! 
 You make me so sad!</b>

07:26.090 --> 07:28.680
<b>Huh? What’s going on?</b>

07:28.680 --> 07:31.930
<b>I get it... 
 This is Team Rocket’s Manene!</b>

07:31.930 --> 07:33.220
<b>Huh?!</b>

07:33.220 --> 07:35.730
<b>So that’s why Pikachu 
 was wary of it.</b>

07:35.730 --> 07:37.600
<b>That thing...</b>

07:38.150 --> 07:43.230
<b>It betrayed us and ran off 
 to try and meet Junsa in this forest!</b>

07:43.230 --> 07:48.990
<b>Selling us out to the police... 
 It’s a disgrace to villains everywhere, meow!</b>

07:50.870 --> 07:53.620
<b>Hand Manene over, meow.</b>

07:53.620 --> 07:55.540
<b>If that’s what’s going on...</b>

07:58.120 --> 07:59.790
<b>There’s no way I’ll give it to you!</b>

07:59.790 --> 08:02.380
<b>Would the outsider 
 stay out of our business?</b>

08:02.380 --> 08:04.800
<b>Team Rocket never forgives traitors!</b>

08:05.340 --> 08:09.050
<b>We’ll catch it and sentence it 
 to Chaotic Scratches, meow!</b>

08:13.390 --> 08:15.060
<b>Pikachu, use 100,000 Volts!</b>

08:22.650 --> 08:26.110
<b>Manene! 
 Don’t go thinking we’re done with you!</b>

08:26.110 --> 08:28.610
<b>We won’t give up, meow!</b>

08:28.610 --> 08:31.160
<b>We’ll be coming back for you!</b>

08:35.580 --> 08:37.370
<b>You don’t have to bother!</b>

08:37.370 --> 08:41.500
<b>We need to hurry to Ms. Junsa! 
 We don’t have a moment to waste!</b>

08:41.500 --> 08:45.050
<b>So... I have a favor to ask, 
 li’l Manene.</b>

08:45.050 --> 08:47.340
<b>Once you meet her, please,</b>

08:47.340 --> 08:51.550
<b>tell Ms. Junsa all about everything 
 that I, Takeshi, did to protect—</b>

08:53.600 --> 08:57.350
<b>Ow, ow, ow... 
 Let me dream...</b>

08:57.350 --> 09:00.310
<b>Okay, okay, 
 you can dream when you’re asleep.</b>

09:01.440 --> 09:03.270
<b>I’m going numb!</b>

09:04.650 --> 09:07.990
<b>Manene, 
 we’ll take you to the meet-up spot.</b>

09:07.990 --> 09:09.150
<b>Come with us!</b>

09:23.830 --> 09:25.840
<b>Morobareru?!</b>

09:25.840 --> 09:27.090
<b>Everyone, get down!</b>

09:32.180 --> 09:35.550
<b>Once Manene has their trust, 
 it’s your turn, meow.</b>

09:35.550 --> 09:38.520
<b>Isolate them one by one, meow.</b>

09:44.560 --> 09:46.940
<b>Mushroom Spores! 
 They’ll put us to sleep!</b>

09:46.940 --> 09:49.030
<b>Runpappa, use Water Gun!</b>

10:01.910 --> 10:04.580
<b>Why’d they just <i>attack</i> like that?</b>

10:04.580 --> 10:07.920
<b>Either they think 
 we’re invading their turf, or...</b>

10:07.920 --> 10:09.420
<b>...they’re Team Rocket in pursuit!</b>

10:09.420 --> 10:10.210
<b>Huh?</b>

10:10.210 --> 10:12.510
<b>Satoshi and Kasumi, 
 you go on ahead.</b>

10:12.510 --> 10:14.090
<b>I’ll figure something out here.</b>

10:14.090 --> 10:15.340
<b>Got it!</b>

10:15.340 --> 10:16.800
<b>Takeshi, be careful!</b>

10:17.720 --> 10:18.510
<b>Yeah!</b>

10:19.100 --> 10:21.810
<b>Runpappa, use Wobbly Dance!</b>

10:22.890 --> 10:26.230
<b>Lalala La-la-la - Oh, what a wonderful</b>

10:26.230 --> 10:30.230
<b>Lalala La-la-la - string of letters!</b>

10:30.230 --> 10:31.940
<b>Lalala - And I mean</b>

10:31.940 --> 10:35.320
<b>...Lalala - And I mean...</b>

10:35.320 --> 10:35.700
<b>“G”</b>

10:35.700 --> 10:36.160
<b>“I”</b>

10:36.160 --> 10:36.570
<b>“R”</b>

10:36.570 --> 10:36.990
<b>“L”</b>

10:36.990 --> 10:37.780
<b>“S”!</b>

10:37.780 --> 10:39.700
<b>I’m quick to fall in love</b>

10:40.330 --> 10:42.790
<b>I know I am!</b>

10:47.710 --> 10:48.790
<b>Which way?</b>

10:49.960 --> 10:50.920
