11:04.560 --> 11:09.480
<b>Dragon</b>

11:04.560 --> 11:09.480
<b>m 0 0 m 1290 960 l 1530 960 l 1530 1024.5 l 1290 1024.5</b>

11:21.290 --> 11:22.240
<b>A Pururill!</b>

11:24.370 --> 11:25.710
<b>100,000 Volts!</b>

11:33.510 --> 11:34.670
<b>A Deathmas?!</b>

11:34.670 --> 11:36.090
<b>Hitodeman, use Water Gun!</b>

11:45.230 --> 11:46.850
<b>Satoshi, keep going!</b>

11:46.850 --> 11:49.810
<b>I bet they’re members 
 of Team Rocket, too!</b>

11:49.810 --> 11:50.560
<b>Kasumi...</b>

11:50.560 --> 11:52.070
<b>Got it.</b>

11:59.070 --> 12:01.950
<b>Koduck! 
 You’re gonna fight?</b>

12:02.870 --> 12:03.540
<b>Huh?</b>

12:06.750 --> 12:10.080
<b>Gah... Hey, calm down!</b>

12:16.050 --> 12:18.220
<b>Manene, is it even farther?</b>

12:23.100 --> 12:24.350
<b>Pikachu!</b>

12:24.350 --> 12:25.520
<b>Go!{He’s off on his own journey now. Satoshi, are you going senile?} Goukazaru!</b>

12:26.770 --> 12:27.770
<b>Mach Punch!</b>

12:39.780 --> 12:41.780
<b>Muscippa and Pumpjin!</b>

12:43.030 --> 12:44.080
<b>Pikachu.</b>

12:44.660 --> 12:46.910
<b>You take Manene.</b>

12:46.910 --> 12:49.290
<b>I’ll hold these guys off!</b>

12:50.040 --> 12:52.380
<b>Make sure it gets to Ms. Junsa!</b>

12:58.510 --> 12:59.630
<b>Go, Luchabull!</b>

13:07.520 --> 13:08.930
<b>Let’s go!</b>

13:43.390 --> 13:47.220
<b>We’d never let you get away, 
 li’l Manene.</b>

13:47.220 --> 13:50.730
<b>Team Rocket never forgives traitors.</b>

13:51.390 --> 13:53.310
<b>Accept your punishment, meow.</b>

14:01.740 --> 14:04.110
<b>Manene, prepare yourself!</b>

14:05.620 --> 14:06.240
<b>Now, meow!</b>

14:06.240 --> 14:06.950
<b>All right!</b>

14:06.950 --> 14:07.530
<b>Fire!</b>

14:07.530 --> 14:08.240
<b>Huh?</b>

14:16.090 --> 14:16.670
<b>Meow?!</b>

14:16.670 --> 14:17.960
<b>No way!</b>

14:17.960 --> 14:20.880
<b>It was going so well 
 up until now...</b>

14:20.880 --> 14:22.720
<b>Maaiika!</b>

14:20.880 --> 14:22.720
<b>Ah, well!</b>

14:29.970 --> 14:34.270
<b>Manene! You did a great job! 
 Leave the rest to us!</b>

14:57.250 --> 15:01.300
<b>Guys! Don’t you <i>dare</i> 
 let Pikachu get away!</b>

15:02.630 --> 15:03.800
<b>Shing!</b>

15:09.050 --> 15:11.180
<b>We’ll all attack, meow.</b>

15:11.180 --> 15:12.310
<b>Get ready!</b>

15:55.270 --> 15:56.600
<b>What was that?</b>

15:57.060 --> 15:59.100
<b>Goukazaru, Luchabull, 
 come with me!</b>

16:09.160 --> 16:10.530
<b>The signal, meow!</b>

16:10.530 --> 16:12.280
<b>They figured out our plan?!</b>

16:12.280 --> 16:14.410
<b>Let’s catch Pikachu quick 
 and retreat!</b>

16:23.590 --> 16:25.460
<b>Let’s catch him, too!</b>

16:25.460 --> 16:26.970
<b>Fire!</b>

16:27.340 --> 16:28.880
<b>Flare Drive!</b>

16:37.100 --> 16:38.100
<b>Pikachu!</b>

16:48.650 --> 16:50.740
<b>Behold: the Team Rocket...{NEP}</b>

16:51.240 --> 16:52.530
<b>...Revengers!{NEP}</b>

16:55.040 --> 16:57.250
<b>These guys are super strong.</b>

16:55.040 --> 16:58.580
<b>The “Ro” in “Team Rocket” stands for “Romanticism”!</b>

16:57.250 --> 16:59.540
<b>Hand over Pikachu right now, meow!</b>

16:58.580 --> 17:01.750
<b>The “ke” in “Team Rocket” stands for “Keenness”!</b>

16:59.540 --> 17:01.750
<b>Argh... What’s going on?</b>

17:01.750 --> 17:04.800
<b>Manene! 
 Didn’t you leave Team Rocket?!</b>

17:01.750 --> 17:04.800
<b>The little “c” in “Team Rocket” between the two stands for...</b>

17:04.800 --> 17:06.880
<b>That was a complete lie, meow.</b>

17:04.800 --> 17:06.380
<b>“‘Course, we’re villains!”</b>

17:06.380 --> 17:07.800
<b>“Come on, come at us!”</b>

17:06.880 --> 17:09.930
<b>It was an act 
 to isolate Pikachu, meow.</b>

17:07.800 --> 17:11.340
<b>“Clearly, Pikachu’s too strong, meow!”</b>

17:09.930 --> 17:13.640
<b>You fell hook, line, and sinker 
 for Manene’s masterful performance!</b>

17:11.390 --> 17:14.510
<b>“What an awful feeling!” we scream as we blast off again,</b>

17:13.640 --> 17:15.140
<b>Manene!</b>

17:14.510 --> 17:17.680
<b>and beneath us we see a little, tiny earth,</b>

17:15.140 --> 17:20.190
<b>Now, Revengers! 
 Let’s nab each and every one of ‘em!</b>

17:17.680 --> 17:20.980
<b>forests, mountains and Pokémon...</b>

17:20.980 --> 17:25.860
<b>They all blend together! What a great feeling!</b>

17:25.860 --> 17:28.990
<b>Wherever we land,</b>

17:28.990 --> 17:32.200
<b>we’ll have a meal to prepare ourselves for tomorrow</b>

17:29.190 --> 17:30.490
<b>Dodge it!</b>

17:32.200 --> 17:35.490
<b>We look up and see the shining moon</b>

17:32.740 --> 17:33.870
<b>Here it comes!</b>

17:33.870 --> 17:35.490
<b>You deal with it, Sonansu!</b>

17:35.490 --> 17:38.580
<b>We look each other in the eye and laugh together</b>

17:41.830 --> 17:48.340
<b>We’re the invincible Team Rocket!</b>

17:48.340 --> 17:51.930
<b>Scaring crying children into silence...</b>

17:51.930 --> 17:53.930
<b>Team Rocket!</b>

17:54.600 --> 17:55.390
<b>A Namakero!</b>

18:00.350 --> 18:00.890
<b>Satoshi?</b>

18:16.490 --> 18:18.870
<b>Did Satoshi just... float?</b>

18:18.870 --> 18:19.830
<b>Yeah...</b>

18:21.710 --> 18:24.210
<b>It’s you, isn’t it, Latias?</b>

18:30.380 --> 18:31.840
<b>Latias?!</b>

18:31.840 --> 18:33.130
<b>How?!</b>

18:36.180 --> 18:37.970
<b>That’s the one from before!</b>

18:44.060 --> 18:46.900
<b>Huh? Wh-What ever is the matter...?</b>

18:46.900 --> 18:48.690
<b>Punishment, meow?</b>

18:53.110 --> 18:56.110
<b><i>What an awful feeling!</i></b>

18:58.660 --> 19:00.540
<b>Wow...</b>

19:08.670 --> 19:10.750
<b>Sorry for the scare.</b>

19:16.890 --> 19:18.350
<b>Ugh...</b>

19:18.350 --> 19:21.350
<b>How did our plan fail, meow?</b>

19:21.350 --> 19:24.810
<b>Manene’s acting was perfect.</b>

19:26.520 --> 19:29.730
<b>Kojiro, weren’t you slow 
 to fire the net?</b>

19:30.110 --> 19:32.280
<b>You’re blaming this on me?</b>

19:33.740 --> 19:38.740
<b>That was because you two called out 
 “Now!” and “Fire!” at a bad time!</b>

19:38.740 --> 19:40.530
<b>It wasn’t my fault, meow!</b>

19:40.530 --> 19:42.330
<b>You sure about that?</b>

19:44.000 --> 19:47.830
<b>Musashi, you got greedy 
 and told us to nab them all.</b>

19:47.830 --> 19:51.290
<b>Huh?! But that’s just 
 what you <i>do</i> in an operation!</b>

19:51.290 --> 19:54.420
<b>Your senses of evil 
 have gotten numb, haven’t they?!</b>

19:54.420 --> 19:58.140
<b>Huh, meow?! There are things 
 you should never say, meow!</b>

19:58.140 --> 19:59.760
<b>What’s with you?!</b>

19:59.760 --> 20:01.430
<b>What’s wrong with you?</b>

20:06.060 --> 20:07.520
<b>This is it for us, meow.{poetic phrase for quitting}</b>

20:07.520 --> 20:09.060
<b>Yeah, it’s the end of the line.</b>

20:09.730 --> 20:11.520
<b>The end of the line indeed.</b>

20:12.730 --> 20:13.940
<b>See ya!</b>

20:19.820 --> 20:21.320
<b>I’m glad to see you again!</b>

20:23.160 --> 20:25.450
<b>That vision I saw of Pikachu...</b>

20:25.450 --> 20:26.960
<b>That was you, wasn’t it?</b>

20:26.960 --> 20:27.830
